WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:03.770
-The electoral college
officially voted today

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.204
to make Joe Biden the next
President of the United States.

00:00:05.204 --> 00:00:07.273
But President Trump and the
Republican Party are still

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:10.209
engaged in a desperate attempt
to dismantle our democracy.

00:00:10.209 --> 00:00:12.945
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:12.945 --> 00:00:16.916 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:19.018
As bleak as things are right
now,

00:00:19.018 --> 00:00:21.621
today was a truly historic
day that provided at least

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:23.289
a few glimmers of hope.

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:25.591
This morning, we witnessed
the first non-trial

00:00:25.591 --> 00:00:28.928
COVID vaccines administered to
frontline healthcare workers.

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:31.597
And, man, I never thought
I'd be so happy

00:00:31.597 --> 00:00:33.099
to see someone get a shot.

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:35.668
This must be what it felt like
watching the moon landing.

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:39.372
It was a historic scientific
achievement that you just know

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:41.840
a bunch of idiot jabronis are
going to say was faked.

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.776
"That wasn't real,
Stanley Kubrick shot that."

00:00:43.776 --> 00:00:44.877
"Stanley Kubrick is dead."

00:00:44.877 --> 00:00:47.280
"Yeah, that's what they want you
to think!"

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:49.616
And of course, Trump and his
allies couldn't help but rush

00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:51.784
to claim credit for this medical
breakthrough.

00:00:51.784 --> 00:00:54.787
-Why does it seem that Joe Biden
is trying to take credit

00:00:54.787 --> 00:00:57.056
for this vaccine, and don't you
think we should call it

00:00:57.056 --> 00:00:59.826
the Trump vaccine, given
everything that he's done?

00:00:59.826 --> 00:01:01.528
-Do they not realize the vaccine

00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:03.696
is always named after
the disease --

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:06.199
the polio vaccine,
the measles vaccine?

00:01:06.199 --> 00:01:07.600
If you call it
the Trump vaccine,

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:09.435
that would mean -- Okay, yeah.

00:01:09.435 --> 00:01:11.270
Okay. They should definitely
call it that.

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:13.539
Trump has done everything he can
to help spread the disease,

00:01:13.539 --> 00:01:15.708
and when he had the chance
to order more vaccine,

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:16.742
he passed on it.

00:01:16.742 --> 00:01:19.011
I doubt he even knows how
a vaccine works.

00:01:19.011 --> 00:01:22.148
I would bet a year's salary that
without assistance

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:24.550
and out of context if he saw
the word vaccine,

00:01:24.550 --> 00:01:26.819
he would pronounce it
va-chi-ni.

00:01:26.819 --> 00:01:29.055
[ As Trump ]
I like my va-chi-ni with clams.

00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:31.824
That's why I'm not getting it
in the first wave.

00:01:31.824 --> 00:01:34.694
I'm waiting for the clams.

00:01:34.694 --> 00:01:36.396
[ Normal voice ] One time,
he went up to the CDC

00:01:36.396 --> 00:01:38.364
and held a printout
of a coronavirus particle

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:39.898
like a hungover college
sophomore

00:01:39.898 --> 00:01:41.367
who forgot to do
a science project.

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:44.170
Another time, he asked
scientists and vaccine makers

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:46.906
at the White House if they could
use a flu vaccine

00:01:46.906 --> 00:01:48.174
to cure coronavirus.

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:50.176
You take a solid flu vaccine,

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:51.610
you don't think that would have
an impact

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:53.446
or much of an impact on corona?

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:01.253
-For a guy who loves to
surround himself with yes-men,

00:02:01.253 --> 00:02:03.956
Trump backs down very easily
when you tell him no.

00:02:03.956 --> 00:02:05.725
[ As Trump ] Could you use
a flu vaccine for this?

00:02:05.725 --> 00:02:06.992
[ Normal voice ] "No."
[ As Trump ] No, yeah.

00:02:06.992 --> 00:02:08.394
No. I was also a no.

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:10.696
Just want to make sure we're
all on the same page.

00:02:10.696 --> 00:02:12.465
Second question,
what about that giant needle

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:13.633
