the answer.

00:02:19.371 --> 00:02:21.073
[ Normal voice ] It really is
a cult of personality.

00:02:21.073 --> 00:02:23.209
Trump spends the majority of his
time golfing and tweeting

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:25.311
at the TV, and yet his
supporters think he's some sort

00:02:25.311 --> 00:02:27.347
