00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:31.450
Listen to how unhinged
and detached from reality

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:33.819
these people are.
-I just feel for the president.

00:02:33.819 --> 00:02:36.422
I see the pain
and the frustration.

00:02:36.422 --> 00:02:38.224
