00:09:46.652 --> 00:09:49.288
-Oh, well, I think both work.
Seriously --

00:09:49.288 --> 00:09:54.626
[ Laughter ]

00:09:54.626 --> 00:09:57.496
[ As Bane ] I will bring you
to your knees, Shoemaker!

00:09:57.496 --> 00:09:59.732
[ Laughter ]

00:09:59.732 --> 00:10:02.501
Seriously, if you famously
had coronavirus

00:10:02.501 --> 00:10:05.303
and were at the epicenter of
multiple high-profile outbreaks,

00:10:05.303 --> 00:10:06.805
you might want to consider
wearing a mask

00:10:06.805 --> 00:10:08.073
around other people.

00:10:08.073 --> 00:10:10.208
At this point, getting close
to Trump is like playing

00:10:10.208 --> 00:10:12.611
seven minutes in heaven with
the monkey from "Outbreak."

00:10:12.611 --> 00:10:14.680
Oh, right, I always forget
it's one of those

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:16.215
small squirrel-ass monkeys.

00:10:16.215 --> 00:10:17.783
I'll confess, whenever
I remember that movie,

00:10:17.783 --> 00:10:19.418
I picture a chimpanzee.

00:10:19.418 --> 00:10:21.487
Trump could choose any day
to urge Americans

00:10:21.487 --> 00:10:24.023
and especially his supporters
to stay home

00:10:24.023 --> 00:10:25.491
and listen to public health
officials.

00:10:25.491 --> 00:10:27.826
He could be leading the charge
for an aid package

00:10:27.826 --> 00:10:29.095
to help the millions
of Americans

00:10:29.095 --> 00:10:30.228
who are suffering right now.

00:10:30.228 --> 00:10:31.664
Instead, he's golfing

00:10:31.664 --> 00:10:33.932
and telling insane stories
to Fox News.

00:10:33.932 --> 00:10:36.268
-When I took over we had
a depleted military.

00:10:36.268 --> 00:10:37.369
We had no ammunition.

00:10:37.369 --> 00:10:40.039
I'll never forget a very
overrated general

00:10:40.039 --> 00:10:42.741
coming to see me and saying,
"Sir, we have no ammunition."

00:10:42.741 --> 00:10:45.578
But we have it totally rebuilt.

00:10:45.578 --> 00:10:47.445
And our nuclear is now
tippy-top.

00:10:47.445 --> 00:10:49.381
And just hope to God you never
have to use it.

00:10:49.381 --> 00:10:52.284
-Ah, yes, that well-known
military term "tippy-top."

00:10:52.284 --> 00:10:53.618
Whenever Trump is talking about

00:10:53.618 --> 00:10:55.321
something technical
he doesn't know anything about,

00:10:55.321 --> 00:10:57.523
he sounds like "Mrs. Doubtfire"
pretending to be British.

00:10:57.523 --> 00:10:59.157
[ High-pitched British accent ]
Oh, dear! You want to fill

00:10:59.157 --> 00:11:01.760
the teacup with the sugar
all the way to the tippy-top!

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:04.096
[ Normal voice ] Can you imagine
Trump in the situation room

00:11:04.096 --> 00:11:06.565
surrounded by generals deciding
whether to launch a nuke?

00:11:06.565 --> 00:11:08.868
Sir, the Russians have initiated
a launch sequence.

00:11:08.868 --> 00:11:11.503
Should we respond with the ICBMs
or the B-52s?

00:11:11.503 --> 00:11:13.305
[ As Trump ] Neither.
Tell them we'll be launching

00:11:13.305 --> 00:11:14.540
the tippy-tops!

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:16.574
Now, if you need me,
I'll be in my bunker,

00:11:16.574 --> 00:11:18.844
peeing my jammy-jams.

00:11:18.844 --> 00:11:20.612
[ Normal voice ] Also, why did
he say that he learned this

00:11:20.612 --> 00:11:22.181
from an overrated general?

00:11:22.181 --> 00:11:24.717
Trump hates people so much that
even when it would help him

00:11:24.717 --> 00:11:27.586
make his point, he undermines
their credibility.

00:11:27.586 --> 00:11:29.254
[ As Trump ] Yes, detective,
I have an alibi

00:11:29.254 --> 00:11:33.558
for the night of the murder --
Call Lyin' Eddie Exaggerations.

00:11:33.558 --> 00:11:36.728
This guy should be treated like
a dog, so, so dishonest.

00:11:36.728 --> 00:11:39.798
Lyin' Eddie!
He knows where I was last night.

00:11:39.798 --> 00:11:41.834
[ Normal voice ] And why
does he keep repeating the lie

00:11:41.834 --> 00:11:44.436
that the military was out of
ammunition when he took office?

00:11:44.436 --> 00:11:46.972
In Trump's mind,
we had Navy warships

00:11:46.972 --> 00:11:48.406
patrolling international waters

00:11:48.406 --> 00:11:51.042
armed with nothing more
than t-shirt cannons.

00:11:51.042 --> 00:11:53.045
"Captain, the enemy ship
is getting closer!"

00:11:53.045 --> 00:11:55.347
Well, it's your unlucky day,
you sons of bitches,

00:11:55.347 --> 00:11:59.517
because I assure you,
y'all not ready for this!

00:11:59.517 --> 00:12:02.088 line:0%
[ Upbeat music plays ]

00:12:02.088 --> 00:12:04.924
Fire!
[ Air hisses, t-shirt thunks ]

00:12:04.924 --> 00:12:05.757
Fire!

00:12:05.757 --> 00:12:06.625
[ Air hisses, t-shirt thunks ]

00:12:06.625 --> 00:12:08.694
[ Laughter ]

00:12:08.694 --> 00:12:11.797
Fire!
[ Air hisses, t-shirt thunks ]

00:12:11.797 --> 00:12:13.832
Virtually...
[ Music fades out ]

00:12:13.832 --> 00:12:16.268
[ Laughter ]

00:12:18.537 --> 00:12:20.606
Virtually the entirety of the
Republican Party

00:12:20.606 --> 00:12:23.675 line:0%
and right-wing media apparatus
are engaged in a coordinated

00:12:23.675 --> 00:12:25.611 line:0%
effort to end democracy
in the United States

00:12:25.611 --> 00:12:28.513
amid an unprecedented
public health crisis

00:12:28.513 --> 00:12:29.648
they refuse to deal with.

00:12:29.648 --> 00:12:31.784
It's an unhinged,
authoritarian movement

00:12:31.784 --> 00:12:33.752
from the bottom all
the way up to...

00:12:33.752 --> 00:12:36.522
-Tippy-top.
-This has been "A Closer Look."

